---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import { default as headshot } from '@/images/ProfHeadshot.jpg'
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="About">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="profile-image">
    <Image src={headshot} width={400} alt="Professional Headshot" class="profile-picture" loading="eager" />
  </div>
    <div class="text-content">
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p>Welcome! My name is Abdourahmane Kounta, nicknamed Abdaty, but I'm glad to go by either.
        I was born in Bamako, Mali, and came to the U.S at a young age. I am a proud Muslim and lifelong learner.
      </p>

      <br />
      <p>Currently, I am pursuing my Bachelor's Degree as a Computer Engineering student at the University of Cincinnati.
        As an eager hands on learner, I love exploring new technologies. My interests and experiences lead me
        to a lot of software projects, but I am just as interested in hardware - specifically microelectronics and robotics.
        In my free time, I am often tinkering with a Raspberry Pi, trying to diagnose why it's not doing what
        I definitely programmed and wired it to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-container {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.profile-image {
  margin-right: 20px;
}

.text-content {
  flex-grow: 1;
  font-size: larger;
}

.profile-picture {
  border-radius: 8px;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-container {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .profile-image, .text-content {
    margin: 20px;
  }
}
</style>
